[init]
<$Config,sw_enDead2=0>
<$Config,sw_enDead3=0>
<$Config,sw_enDead4=0>
<$Config,sw_enDead5=0>
<$Config,sw_enDead6=0>
<$Config,sw_enDead8=0>

[options]
[A.]
                                                     <h2>A taste of Freedom~.<a href="#mission21">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                                      ~[Iresidence.6]
<br>
After you beat the Furies in the 10 year tournament they allowed you to return to your home to Nimbus.
 Although the {sw_god5} is temporarily trapped as a nimbian priest he still has the power of darkness.
 He has sent his followers to kill you once and for all. He wants you dead so bad that he has offered
  freedom to the one who sacrifices you.
<p>
You have been travelling throughout most of the evening. You finally stop to rest.
 You are about another days journey before you reach your homeland.
  When you awake in the morning you realize that you have been surrounded by islands
 and they have managed to bridge around your entire island!
<p>
You think to yourself ~ICan I beat all of these enemies all by myself?~. 
<p>
<i>You were almost free. Hope you enjoyed your Taste of Freedom.</i>
<p>
            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                                  <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                            <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>                            <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Enter Hades Realm</a>                    <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I'm too Scared!</a>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,priestmove3.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.

<$PlaySound,somethingCreated.wav>

