[ai1PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the cruel {sw_god5}.</h2><br>
<i>"Don't worry priest, I will rescue you."</i>
<p>Haha! You must be an idiot to think I will give you another chance!
Your blood will help me become stronger with the powers of death.
<$PlaySound,treasonCast.wav>
